    "text": "Integral Power Term is same as odd term in exapansion<br /><br />Odd Term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mtext>50</mtext></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mtext>50</mtext></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />Sum of coefficients<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mtext>50</mtext></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mtext>50</mtext></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mtext>50</mtext></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
